---
import Container from '../ui/Container.astro';
import Card from '../ui/Card.astro';
---

<section class="py-12">
  <Container>
    <Card class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">A personal message from the developer</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
        <p><em>Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh</em> (Peace be upon you),</p>
        <p>
          Nimaz was born from a desire to create a tool that would serve our Ummah (community) in
          their daily spiritual practice. As a developer and a Muslim, I wanted to combine my
          technical skills with my faith to produce something truly beneficial that could help us
          all stay connected to our prayers and religious obligations.
        </p>
        <p>
          This app represents countless hours of research, development, and testing to ensure
          accurate prayer times and reliable Qibla direction. It's my sincere hope that Nimaz
          becomes a trusted companion in your spiritual journey, making it easier to fulfill your
          religious duties wherever you may be.
        </p>
        <p>
          I welcome your feedback, suggestions, and prayers as we continue to refine and improve
          this humble offering. May Allah accept this work as a form of sadaqah jariyah (ongoing
          charity) and make it beneficial for all who use it.
        </p>
        <p>Jazakum Allahu Khayran (May Allah reward you with goodness),</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">Arshad Shah</p>
      </div>
    </Card>
  </Container>
</section>
